---
import DiagramShell from "./DiagramShell.astro";
---

<DiagramShell
  title="Evidence and verification flow"
  caption="Request and action decisions each produce Verifiable Decision Records. Canonical evidence feeds BeaconGuard Verify. AI-assisted insights remain outside the trusted path."
  className="bg-diagram--evidence"
>
  <div class="bg-flow" role="list">
    <div class="bg-flow-step bg-flow-step--inputs" role="listitem">
      <strong>Governed transaction inputs</strong>
      <ul class="bg-inline-list">
        <li>Request context and identity</li>
        <li>Active Verified Release</li>
        <li>AI-generated result binding (when present)</li>
        <li>Declared intended enterprise action</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="bg-flow-step bg-flow-step--decision" role="listitem">
      Request Admission · Result-to-Action
      <span>ALLOW or DENY</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="bg-flow-step bg-outcome-evidence" role="listitem">
      <strong>Verifiable Decision Records</strong>
      <span>Related request and action decisions</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="bg-flow-step" role="listitem">Configured Evidence Provider</div>
    <div class="bg-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="bg-flow-step bg-flow-step--boundary" role="listitem">
      BeaconGuard Verify
      <span>Read-only functional domain</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-verify-grid" role="list">
      <div class="bg-flow-step" role="listitem">Executive Reporting</div>
      <div class="bg-flow-step" role="listitem">Decision Explorer</div>
      <div class="bg-flow-step" role="listitem">Deterministic Reconstruction</div>
      <div class="bg-flow-step" role="listitem">Source Evidence</div>
      <div class="bg-flow-step" role="listitem">Replay Verification</div>
      <div class="bg-flow-step" role="listitem">Verifiable Export</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-flow-step bg-verify-insights" role="listitem">
      AI-Assisted Insights
      <span>Separate · non-authoritative · not in the trusted path</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div slot="text">
    <p>
      Governed transaction inputs feed Request Admission and Result-to-Action
      decisions. Each decision produces a Verifiable Decision Record. Records
      are stored via the configured evidence provider and inspected through
      BeaconGuard Verify: Executive Reporting, Decision Explorer, Deterministic
      Reconstruction, Source Evidence, Replay Verification, and Verifiable
      Export. AI-Assisted Insights are non-authoritative and outside the trusted
      path. Retention and integrity depend on the evidence provider and
      deployment controls.
    </p>
  </div>
</DiagramShell>
